    "description": "The war is over, and hero Dias is finally rewarded with land of his own—only to discover it's a barren frontier with no people, no villages, and no sign of civilization. With nothing but endless grassland ahead of him, Dias sets out to build a domain from the ground up. But after meeting Alna, a mysterious girl with a blue horn, his lonely frontier is about to spring to life. \n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)\n\nNote: Ryoumin 0-Nin Start no Henkyou Ryoushu-sama is streaming a week advance of the TV broadcast on Prime Video beginning July 3rd, 2026. Regular broadcasting began on July 10th, 2026.",
